<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6 Practical Considerations for Using Judge Adapters ‣ Topic-Specific Classifiers are Better Relevance Judges than Prompted LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Topic-Specific Classifiers are Better Relevance Judges than Prompted LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 7 Conclusion ‣ Topic-Specific Classifiers are Better Relevance Judges than Prompted LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Future Work</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
